abstract: >-
  An independent, sanitized research release covering Hasselblad X-System
  CIM firmware formats, camera UI behavior, autofocus experiments, feature
  extensions, and safe offline validation tools. Vendor firmware, extracted
  proprietary binaries, device logs, and deployable system-write packages are
  not included.
